{"at": "2026-11-02T16:52:59.642550+00:00", "event_id": "01M6EJVC3TF9V6GJJHXNZNA1AP", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M6EJRSBG0S4J4P6R3V8M6BAE", "final_answer": "Charter generate/interview --json (and the sibling text output plus _display_path()) report repository-relative paths with the host separator, so a Windows consumer reads .kittify\\\\charter\\\\charter.md where Linux and macOS read .kittify/charter/charter.md. Same defect #6277 fixed for charter synthesize; follow-up tracked as issue #7044.", "mission_id": "01M6EJRRMXKMXWW59617FST7YV", "mission_slug": "charter-reported-paths-posix-7044", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-11-02T16:52:59.642550Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M6EJRSBG0S4J4P6R3V8M6BAE", "state_entered_at": "2026-11-02T16:52:59.638789Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
{"at": "2026-11-02T16:53:02.551981+00:00", "event_id": "01M6EJVEYRDN74BSTZSH4QVK8V", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M6EJRSYYTMBWV61FKHVQ643P", "final_answer": "Under a Windows path-rendering simulation both envelopes (charter_path, interview_path), the Charter:/Interview file: text lines, the missing/malformed-interview error and _display_path() report zero backslashes and the same .kittify/... strings POSIX reports; the out-of-repo fallback still returns a path and pre-existing POSIX expectations pass unchanged. See SC-001..SC-004.", "mission_id": "01M6EJRRMXKMXWW59617FST7YV", "mission_slug": "charter-reported-paths-posix-7044", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-11-02T16:53:02.551981Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M6EJRSYYTMBWV61FKHVQ643P", "state_entered_at": "2026-11-02T16:53:02.551074Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
